# Keep every text file LF in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# The build runs on a macOS runner and applies patches/xnu/*.patch with `git apply`; a CRLF
# checkout would break both the shell scripts and the patches. Windows checkouts therefore get LF
# too - the scripts are run with bash, never with cmd.exe.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.dbr binary
*.img binary
*.macho binary
*.a binary
*.o binary
*.efi binary
*.dtb binary
